{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 0, "text": "Black's bishop on d5 is attacked by White's bishop on e4", "type": "state", "subject": "d5", "structured": {"kind": "attacked", "square": "d5", "by": "white"}, "cost_usd": 0.005909}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 1, "text": "after Bxe4 Kxe4, we get a pawn endgame: White Ke4, pawns b2, e3, e5 vs Black Kb4, pawns c5, e6", "type": "state", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 2, "text": "Black's king is very active and can immediately target b2 with Kb3", "type": "plan", "subject": "b2", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 3, "text": "after Kd3 Kxb2 Kc4 Kc2 Kxc5 Kd3 Kd6 Kxe3 Kxe6, we reach a position where Black's king can stop the e-pawn", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 4, "text": "this leads to a draw", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 5, "text": "if Black retreats the bishop (e.g., Bc6), White can play Bxc6 winning the bishop", "type": "threat", "subject": "c6", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 6, "text": "Black's king can't recapture from b4", "type": "state", "subject": "b4", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 7, "text": "if Bb3, White plays Bc2 attacking it again", "type": "threat", "subject": "b3", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 8, "text": "Black eventually loses the bishop or enters a worse pawn endgame after Bb3", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 9, "text": "Bxe4 trades bishops enters a pawn endgame where Black's active king on b4 can immediately go after b2", "type": "plan", "subject": "e4", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 10, "text": "this may lead to a draw with perfect play", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 11, "text": "it's Black's best practical chance", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 12, "text": "any bishop retreat allows White to maintain the bishop and dominate", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 13, "text": "after Bxe4 Kxe4 Kb3, White's best is Kd3", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "PEM0a", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 14, "text": "Black's king is extremely active and the c-pawn provides counterplay", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 0, "text": "Black has a rook on h2 which is extremely active near White's king on e2", "type": "state", "subject": "h2", "structured": {"kind": "piece_on_square", "square": "h2", "piece": "rook", "by": "black"}, "cost_usd": 0.00443}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 1, "text": "Rxf2+ is a key tactical shot", "type": "threat", "subject": "f2", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 2, "text": "Rxf2+ exposes the white king", "type": "threat", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 3, "text": "Rxf2+ wins the queen", "type": "threat", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 4, "text": "After Rxf2+ Ke1, Qxe4+ wins the queen with check", "type": "threat", "subject": "e4", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 5, "text": "After Rxf2+ Kd1, Qxe4 wins the queen", "type": "threat", "subject": "e4", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 6, "text": "After Rxf2+ Kd3, Rf3+ forces the king away", "type": "threat", "subject": "f3", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 7, "text": "After Rxf2+ Kd3 Rf3+, Qxe4 wins the queen", "type": "threat", "subject": "e4", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "XcNHS", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 8, "text": "After Rxf2+ Ke3, Qxe4+ Kxe4 Rxf5 wins a piece", "type": "threat", "subject": "f5", "structured": null}
