{"task_id": "8CtXx", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 5, "text": "1...Ke4! heads toward White's pawns while staying central", "type": "plan", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "8CtXx", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 6, "text": "after 2.Kd6 Kd4 3.Ke6 Ke4 4.Kf6 Kxf4 5.Kg7 Kxg5 6.Kxh7, we reach a position where both kings race to the queenside and all pawns are captured, resulting in a K vs K draw", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "8CtXx", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 7, "text": "If White tries 2.Kxb5 Kxf4 3.Kxa5 Kxg5 4.Kb6 h5 5.a4 h4 6.a5 h3 7.a6 h2 8.a7 h1=Q 9.a8=Q, we get Q+b3 vs Q which is also a draw", "type": "unverifiable", "subject": "", "structured": null}
{"task_id": "3I9at", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 0, "text": "Black with connected passed pawns on d4 and e4", "type": "state", "subject": "", "structured": null, "cost_usd": 0.003279}
{"task_id": "3I9at", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-2.4t-a95b", "claim_id": 1, "text": "pushing 1...d3 creates two connected passed pawns that the rook cannot handle", "type": "plan", "subject": "d4", "structured": null}
